# Character quirks (VanGuard build).

vg-trait-category-quirks = Character quirks

vg-trait-fleet-footed-name = Light gait
vg-trait-fleet-footed-desc = You move a little faster than most people of your species.

vg-trait-sturdy-nerves-name = Steady endurance
vg-trait-sturdy-nerves-desc = Tiring work drains you noticeably slower than most people.

vg-trait-cold-hardened-name = Cold-seasoned
vg-trait-cold-hardened-desc = Long shifts in cold rooms taught you to shrug off low temperatures.

vg-trait-clear-head-name = Clear head
vg-trait-clear-head-desc = Alcohol affects you noticeably less than most people around you.

vg-trait-quick-clot-name = Quick-clotting blood
vg-trait-quick-clot-desc = Your wounds stop bleeding faster than usual.

vg-trait-rad-hardened-name = Radiation-hardened
vg-trait-rad-hardened-desc = Your body tolerates radiation better than most.

vg-trait-heavy-gait-name = Heavy gait
vg-trait-heavy-gait-desc = You move a little slower than most people of your species.

vg-trait-weak-nerves-name = Weak endurance
vg-trait-weak-nerves-desc = Tiring work drains you faster than most people.

vg-trait-fragile-name = Fragile build
vg-trait-fragile-desc = Blunt blows and cuts hurt you more than they should.

vg-trait-frostbite-name = Frost-prone
vg-trait-frostbite-desc = Low temperatures bite into you harder than into most people.

vg-trait-thin-blood-name = Poor clotting
vg-trait-thin-blood-desc = Your wounds keep bleeding longer than usual.

vg-trait-rad-sensitive-name = Radiation-sensitive
vg-trait-rad-sensitive-desc = Radiation harms you more than most people.

